and trucks. Iron Horse onsite also working on interior of octagons. Mje set up ground heating system for fiber barn and Bennett started excavating footings.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2025-01-13.png","sigTs":1736823300000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2025-01-14","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2025-01-14","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-00.jpg","ts":1736902500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-01.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-02.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-03.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-04.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-05.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-06.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-07.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-14-08.jpg","ts":1736909340000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":21,"c":"Clear","w":"7","p":".0","h":"93"},{"t":32,"c":"Clear","w":"10","p":".0","h":"66"},{"t":33,"c":"Clear","w":"5","p":".0","h":"67"}],"notes":"Today Iron Horse onsite working rebar at north wall footing on fiber barn. Ready to start second mat and wall dowels tomorrow. Bennett just hung out until 1pm at that point the used excavator to repair ramp access to pit and skid steer was used for snow removal around work areas.\nExcavator with operator 1.0 hour.\nSkid steer with operator 3.5 hours. Skid steer helped iron horse at fiber barn for @ 1.0 hour. Bennett is waiting on material delivery to get started on piping at octagons.","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2025-01-14.png","sigTs":1736909400000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2025-01-15","pid":