an up of post screw pit \ufb02oor, removing ice,snow and debris and then started same work at west octagon. I haven't received Bennett time card yet but they worked 10 hours with Iron Horse working 9","subs":[{"name":"hours.Fiber barn north wall","items":""},{"name":"01-28-25","items":""},{"name":"1:15 pm","items":""},{"name":"Air temp: 51 F","items":""},{"name":"Concrete temp: 53 F","items":""},{"name":"Slump: 4\u201d","items":""},{"name":"Air cont: 5.5%","items":""},{"name":"Sample taken at: @5 y3","items":""}],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2025-01-28.png","sigTs":1738122480000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2025-01-29","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2025-01-29","by":"Jeff Pool","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-00.jpg","ts":1738206300000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-01.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-02.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-03.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-04.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-05.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-06.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-07.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-08.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-09.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-10.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-11.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-12.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-13.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-14.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-15.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-29-16.jpg","ts":1738207500000,"cap":""