""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-30-29.jpg","ts":1738295280000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-30-30.jpg","ts":1738295280000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-30-31.jpg","ts":1738295280000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-30-32.jpg","ts":1738295280000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-30-33.jpg","ts":1738295280000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-01-30-34.jpg","ts":1738295280000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":37,"c":"Overcast","w":"1","p":".0","h":"99"},{"t":41,"c":"Overcast","w":"9","p":".0","h":"98"},{"t":46,"c":"Partially cloudy","w":"8","p":".0","h":"82"}],"notes":"Bennett crew of 11 completed excavation of west and south footings for fiber barn today. Bennett completed 6\" piping and risers at \ufb02ush/screen pits. Started on 8\" riser and piping from \ufb02ush/screen pit to \ufb02ume @ 50% complete. Starting backfill at octagons tomorrow. Iron horse crew of 8 working on east wall forms along with completing west footing rebar and Matt's and east footing and Matt's are completed and ready for concrete pour on Saturday. I had Bennett crew install osf around octagon pits were backfill is at an elevation at top of pits. Security fence company wasn't onsite today to fix fencing. Quality Dairy along with mje crews working on 30\" piping from milking parlor to \ufb02ush pit and 30\" wastewater pipe from \ufb02ush pit to lagoon. While excavator was cleaning up mud and water in area south of pits and north of free stall barn decided to dump 4 loads of mud and muddy water into clean \ufb02ush/screen pits. I stopped them immediately after seeing this activity. I reported antics to Hartman who shared it with Matt Nelson and Hayden Borth. Iron horse saw what they did and offered to start clean up work and I told them absolutely not. Waiting to hear back from mje as to when or who will cleanup this mess. Iron horse made great progress today and Bennett did as well.\nBennett time card from yesterday and today is attached in pictures.","subs":[],"survey":[{"